                    {
                        "sense_id": "758adf2a-81cf-3b3c-8d28-a50ade763e81",
                        "entry_id": "269e2410-3b08-3944-b96f-e974bc906f4c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "milking pail"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "51278113-6527-4e2e-9831-1cdc2a17db9d",
                                "sense_id": "758adf2a-81cf-3b3c-8d28-a50ade763e81",
                                "text": "Благоро́дный посту́пок её ма́тери меня́ плени́л. Я сию́ почте́нную мать с засу́ченными рукава́ми за квашнёю и́ли с подо́йником по́дле коро́вы сра́внивал с городски́ми матеря́ми.",
                                "translation": "Her mother’s noble act enchanted me. I compared this noble mother, with her sleeves rolled up over the dough or over her milking pail near the cow, with urban mothers.",
                                "english": "Her mother’s noble act enchanted me. I compared this noble mother, with her sleeves rolled up over the dough or over her milking pail near the cow, with urban mothers."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
